### Health Check
GET http://localhost:3000/api/health

### Listar Tarefas
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tasks

### Criar Tarefa
POST http://localhost:3000/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "Implementar tela de login",
    "descricao": "Criar o formulario de autenticacao com validacao de campos",
    "estimativa_tempo": 8,
    "deadline": "2026-10-15"
}

### Buscar Tarefa por ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tasks/1

### Atualizar Tarefa
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Implementar tela de login (revisada)",
  "estimativa_tempo": 10
}

### Excluir Tarefa
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/tasks/1
